/P 116 0 R
/E (Organic certification is a process certification. To ensure the credibility of certification and traceability of the product flow, a user friendly web-based traceability system "TRACENET" has been implemented by APEDA for organic products. "TRACENET" covers the entire certification process being followed by the operator ensuring the authenticity of the organic product. All the certificates are issued by the certification bodies through TRACENET.)
